{
  "declaredLength": 9328,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Jeune Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse !\nPuis-je avoir votre attention, je vous prie ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650075006E00650020004400720065007300730065007500100003110000FF020100720073006500200021000A0050007500690073002D006A0065002000610076006F0069007200200076006F00740072006500200061007400740065006E00740069006F006E002C0020006A006500200076006F00750073002000700072006900650020003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aurais besoin que vous délivriez cette lettre\nà la proviseure de l’Institut Nivers.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Des raisons personnelles m’empêchent\nde faire cette livraison moi-même.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voilà pourquoi j’aimerais vous demander\ncette faveur. Puis-je compter sur vous ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020007300FB0072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On dirait que vous cachez quelque chose...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E0020006400690072006100690074002000710075006500200076006F00750073002000630061006300680065007A0020007100750065006C007100750065002000630068006F00730065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si vous avez des doutes sur mes intentions,\npourquoi ne pas accepter ma requête pour<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndécouvrir ce que, d’après vous, je vous cache ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci infiniment. Je pensais bien\nque vous accepteriez ma requête.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500720063006900200069006E00660069006E0069006D0065006E0074002E0020004A0065002000700065006E00730061006900730020006200690065006E000A00710075006500200076006F0075007300200061006300630065007000740065007200690065007A0020006D00610020007200650071007500EA00740065002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voici la lettre que je souhaite faire livrer.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0069006300690020006C00610020006C0065007400740072006500200071007500650020006A006500200073006F0075006800610069007400650020006600610069007200650020006C00690076007200650072002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il faut que cette lettre arrive entre les mains de\nla proviseure de l’<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Institut Nivers<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, je te reconnais !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTu es la jeune personne généreuse qui a retrouvé\nma bague !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qui t’amène à l’Institut Nivers,\naujourd’hui ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007500690020007420190061006D00E8006E0065002000E00020006C20190049006E0073007400690074007500740020004E00690076006500720073002C000A00610075006A006F00750072006420190068007500690020003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je cherche la proviseure.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630068006500720063006800650020006C0061002000700072006F0076006900730065007500720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai une lettre à livrer.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200075006E00650020006C00650074007400720065002000E00020006C00690076007200650072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh... Il se trouve que je suis la proviseure de\nl’institut, donc tu n’aurais pas pu mieux tomber !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous donnez la Lettre Importante à Moïra !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200064006F006E006E0065007A0020006C00610020004C0065007400740072006500200049006D0070006F007200740061006E00740065002000E00020004D006F00EF00720061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qui t’a chargé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe de livrer cette lettre, dis-moi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750069002000742019006100200063006800610072006700E900100003110000FF010000650020006400650020006C006900760072006500720020006300650074007400650020006C00650074007400720065002C0020006400690073002D006D006F00690020003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hum... non, avant cela, je dois vérifier\nquelque chose.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480075006D002E002E002E0020006E006F006E002C0020006100760061006E0074002000630065006C0061002C0020006A006500200064006F006900730020007600E9007200690066006900650072000A007100750065006C007100750065002000630068006F00730065002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourrais-tu me retrouver à <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Bâti-Racines<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> ?\nC’est dans le 6ᵉ arrondissement de Beau-Vert.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci d’être venu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500720063006900200064201900EA007400720065002000760065006E007500100003110000FF01000065002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci de m’avoir rejointe ici.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650072006300690020006400650020006D201900610076006F00690072002000720065006A006F0069006E007400650020006900630069002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aurais préféré enquêter seule,\nmais cette lettre était si étrange que...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl serait sans doute plus simple que je te la lise.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "« Pardonne-moi d’avoir disparu avant de pouvoir\nte prévenir.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl y a 14 ans, j’ai confié ma précieuse bague à\nquelqu’un pour qu’il la répare.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCette personne s’appelait Taragon.\nIl était à la tête de Bâti-Racines. »<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 224
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Jamais je ne me serais attendue à recevoir\nune lettre de mon cher mari décédé...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTu comprendras que j’étais trop bouleversée\npour aller au fond de cette histoire toute seule.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 182
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Êtes-vous monsieur Taragon ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00CA007400650073002D0076006F007500730020006D006F006E00730069006500750072002000540061007200610067006F006E0020003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En effet. Qu’est-ce que j’peux faire pour vous,\nma bonne dame ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000650066006600650074002E0020005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007500650020006A2019007000650075007800200066006100690072006500200070006F0075007200200076006F00750073002C000A006D006100200062006F006E006E0065002000640061006D00650020003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous souvenez-vous d’un homme qui vous aurait\nconfié une bague à réparer ?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nC’était il y a 14 ans...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout à fait !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00750074002000E0002000660061006900740020002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’étais au restaurant avec ma p’tite Narica,\non fêtait son anniversaire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le bonhomme assis à côté était un bon gars,\net même ma p’tite fille l’a trouvé sympathique !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand j’lui ai dit ce que j’faisais de mes deux\nmains, il m’a demandé si j’pouvais sertir<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nune pierre qui s’était délogée d’sa bague.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Apparemment, c’était une bague de fiançailles,\nla même que celle d’sa femme !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cet homme était mon époux...\nMais il... il a eu un horrible accident...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Désolé d’l’entendre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E90073006F006C00E9002000642019006C20190065006E00740065006E006400720065002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qui vous amène, après toutes\nces années ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D00630065002000710075006900200076006F0075007300200061006D00E8006E0065002C002000610070007200E8007300200074006F0075007400650073000A00630065007300200061006E006E00E9006500730020003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh bien, il faut bien que je vous paie pour\nla réparation de la bague.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voyons, madame. Vous plaisantez ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 6068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0079006F006E0073002C0020006D006100640061006D0065002E00200056006F0075007300200070006C0061006900730061006E00740065007A0020003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’peux pas vous faire payer.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais j’veux bien affronter <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\ncomme ça, vous serez pas venu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀes pour rien !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 6144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’attends dans l’garage.\nViens m’voir si le cœur t’en dit !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007420190061007400740065006E00640073002000640061006E00730020006C2019006700610072006100670065002E000A005600690065006E00730020006D20190076006F006900720020007300690020006C0065002000630153007500720020007420190065006E00200064006900740020002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pardon <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>... J’aimerais rembourser\nma dette envers lui. Pourrais-tu... ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cendro m’a pas appris qu’à faire des p’tits pains !\nIl m’a aussi donné des cours de combat !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nJ’vais te montrer ce que j’en ai retenu !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je gagnerai ce combat !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006700610067006E006500720061006900200063006500200063006F006D006200610074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attendez un peu...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E00640065007A00200075006E0020007000650075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux pas t’battre ? Hmmm...\nDans ce cas, je vais p’têt’ garder la bague...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ? À L’ATTAQUE !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 7224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005420190065007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF010000650020003F002000C00020004C201900410054005400410051005500450020002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 7296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Minotaupe ! Minotaupe !\nSi t’es au top, montre-lui d’quoi t’es capable !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069006E006F00740061007500700065002000210020004D0069006E006F0074006100750070006500200021000A005300690020007420190065007300200061007500200074006F0070002C0020006D006F006E007400720065002D006C0075006900200064201900710075006F006900200074201900650073002000630061007000610062006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as pas volé ta réputation ! Mais j’trouve\nqu’on s’en est bien tirés, Minotaupe et moi.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAprès tout c’que t’as fait, j’me suis dit que le seul\nmoyen de te remercier, c’était de m’entraîner pour<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nt’offrir un combat à la hauteur de ton talent !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 252
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma bonne dame, les frais de réparation d’la bague\nsont réglés ! Elle est à vous !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 7972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 8144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous donnez la Bague Souvenirs à Moïra !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 8168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200064006F006E006E0065007A0020006C006100200042006100670075006500200053006F007500760065006E006900720073002000E00020004D006F00EF00720061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Après la disparition de mon mari, je n’ai pas pu\nretrouver sa bague... J’étais effondrée.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais maintenant, la voici réunie avec la mienne.\nJe les chérirai autant que mes souvenirs de lui.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 8252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 195
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, je ne sais comment\nte remercier...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNon seulement tu as retrouvé ma bague,\nmais tu as aussi trouvé celle de mon mari !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 8644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moi, j’suis bien content que cette bague\nait retrouvé sa propriétaire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 8908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 9060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai fait un rêve délicieux...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNous discutions tendrement avec mon mari\nà l’endroit précis où il m’a donné cette bague.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 9072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
